WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.601 --> 00:00:01.830
Hello, everyone.

2
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:04.440
How are you today?

3
00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:18.480
I'm Jot. I'm very happy to see you. I want to play outside,

4
00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:22.170
but first, I need to know about the weather.

5
00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:27.840
Oh, the window is glowing. What is behind the curtains?

6
00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:29.520
Let's look together.

7
00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.731
Wow, look at the bright sun.

8
00:00:39.661 --> 00:00:40.380
It's sunny.

9
00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:43.651
Listen, sunny.

10
00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:47.190
Let's say it together. Sunny.

11
00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:56.940
Great speaking.

12
00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:02.910
When we want to know about the weather, we ask, "How's the weather?"

13
00:01:04.261 --> 00:01:08.551
Listen first. How's the weather? It's sunny.

14
00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:13.321
Now, let's say it together. How's the weather?

15
00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:22.830
It's sunny.

16
00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:32.640
Wonderful.

17
00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:39.750
Oh, I can hear rain. It's rainy.

18
00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:44.940
Listen, rainy.

19
00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:47.220
Let's say it together.

20
00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:48.961
Rainy.

21
00:01:58.021 --> 00:01:58.740
Well done.

22
00:02:01.290 --> 00:02:02.010
How's the weather?

23
00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:11.310
It's rainy.

24
00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:21.510
That's right.

25
00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:26.520
Can you make little raindrops with your fingers?

26
00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:29.760
Pitter-patter.

27
00:02:34.141 --> 00:02:35.040
Lovely rain.

28
00:02:38.610 --> 00:02:41.970
The rain stopped, but where is the sun?

29
00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:44.400
Can you see it?

30
00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:51.870
No, there are lots of clouds. It's cloudy.

31
00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:56.550
Listen, cloudy. Let's say it together.

32
00:02:57.900 --> 00:02:58.470
Cloudy.

33
00:03:07.141 --> 00:03:07.800
Excellent.

34
00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:11.460
How's the weather?

35
00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:21.060
It's cloudy.

36
00:03:29.671 --> 00:03:30.570
Great job.

37
00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:35.910
Brr, it's getting cold.

38
00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:40.980
Look at the snow. It's snowy.

39
00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:44.250
Listen, snowy.

40
00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:48.330
Let's say it together. Snowy.

41
00:03:57.781 --> 00:03:58.470
Fantastic.

42
00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:02.340
How's the weather?

43
00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:12.000
It's snowy.

44
00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:22.410
Can you wave to the snowman?

45
00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:26.370
Hello, snowman.

46
00:04:34.201 --> 00:04:39.060
Now, let's look at the real weather. Look outside where you are.

47
00:04:40.770 --> 00:04:42.270
How's the weather where you are?

48
00:04:44.370 --> 00:04:45.240
Is it sunny?

49
00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:47.760
Is it rainy?

50
00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:49.890
Is it cloudy?

51
00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:52.591
Or is it snowy?

52
00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:55.740
Great weather watching.

53
00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:02.760
Hello, everyone. I'm Tail.

54
00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:05.640
It's quiz time.

55
00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:08.460
Look carefully.

56
00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:10.830
How's the weather?

57
00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:19.230
It's sunny. That's right.

58
00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:21.330
How's the weather?

59
00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:30.781
It's cloudy. Excellent.

60
00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:34.080
How's the weather?

61
00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:43.500
It's rainy. Great job.

62
00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:46.890
One more. How's the weather?

63
00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:56.790
It's snowy. You got them all.

64
00:05:59.281 --> 00:06:01.800
Let's check the weather forecast for Japan.

65
00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:03.870
Look carefully.

66
00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:06.480
Sunny,

67
00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:08.880
rainy,

68
00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:10.680
cloudy,

69
00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:12.870
snowy.

70
00:06:14.130 --> 00:06:18.480
Let's see what the weather will be like. Close your eyes. No peeking.

71
00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:23.820
Open your eyes.

72
00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:26.730
What's missing from the forecast?

73
00:06:32.341 --> 00:06:34.140
Rainy. Great memory.

74
00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:40.500
Let's check the forecast again. Close your eyes. No peeking.

75
00:06:45.151 --> 00:06:46.050
Open your eyes.

76
00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:49.020
What's missing from the forecast?

77
00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:56.490
Snowy. Well done.

78
00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:02.370
One last time. Close your eyes. No peeking.

79
00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:08.010
Open your eyes.

80
00:07:09.210 --> 00:07:11.100
Who's missing from the weather forecast?

81
00:07:16.651 --> 00:07:21.420
It's Tail. Hello. You found me. Great job.

82
00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:23.430
You have a fantastic memory.

83
00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:28.710
Hello, everyone. I'm Boom. It's time to move.

84
00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:32.610
Okay, everyone. Let's stand up.

85
00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:39.510
First, watch. Sunny, stretch up like the sun.

86
00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:53.040
Now you try. Sunny.

87
00:07:58.050 --> 00:07:59.401
Super sunshine!

88
00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:05.280
Rainy, make raindrops with your fingers.

89
00:08:17.880 --> 00:08:19.710
Now you try. Rainy.

90
00:08:26.010 --> 00:08:27.091
Great rain.

91
00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:33.300
Snowy, hug your shoulders and shiver.

92
00:08:47.070 --> 00:08:48.901
Now you try. Snowy.

93
00:08:52.651 --> 00:08:54.870
Brr, boomtastic.

94
00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:57.061
You can sit down now.

95
00:09:00.811 --> 00:09:03.120
Hello, everyone. I'm Echo.

96
00:09:04.681 --> 00:09:06.690
You did a wonderful job.

97
00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:10.080
Let's remember our weather words.

98
00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:12.750
How's the weather?

99
00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:20.640
It's sunny. That's right. How's the weather?

100
00:09:24.151 --> 00:09:26.280
It's rainy. Well done.

101
00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:29.130
How's the weather?

102
00:09:33.030 --> 00:09:34.800
It's cloudy. Great.

103
00:09:36.390 --> 00:09:37.380
How's the weather?

104
00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:43.830
It's snowy. You remembered everything.

105
00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:50.730
Great job, everyone.

106
00:09:51.931 --> 00:09:54.000
You learned four weather words.

107
00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:56.100
Great speaking.

108
00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:58.170
Great moving.

109
00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:00.690
Great thinking.

110
00:10:01.561 --> 00:10:04.920
Thank you for learning with us. See you next time.

111
00:10:06.181 --> 00:10:06.510
See you.

112
00:10:06.509 --> 00:10:06.901
See you.
